# pdftexja build outputs that are NOT version-controlled (plan §6.2):
# font binaries and untracked sidecars are rebuilt at install/TDS time.
# Tracked (NOT ignored): tex/*.cls, tex/*.clo, tex/pdftexja-jfm-*.def
# (payloads + indexes for the 5 built-in presets, plan §5.1), profiles,
# manifests, license/provenance texts.
fonts/pdftexja/*.ttf
fonts/pdftexja/*.tfm
fonts/pdftexja/*.enc
fonts/pdftexja/LICENSE-*.txt
fonts/pdftexja/*-adv.def
fonts/pdftexja/*-cid.def
# TDS bundle
tds/
